{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-01","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":1,"points":null,"unitId":"cell","unitLabel":"세포 구조·세포주기·세포사멸","topic":"세포분열·체세포분열·세포질분열","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["cell","development"],"stem":"일반적인난할방식에관한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서\n모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 경할(meridional\ncleavage)을\n할\n때\n방추사는\n동․식물극축과수평하게형성된다.\nㄴ. 위할(equatorial cleavage)을할때세포질분열면은\n동․식물극축과수직을이룬다.\nㄷ. 난할은체세포분열로분열이거듭될수록핵에대한\n세포질의부피비율이점차감소한다.\nㄹ. 난황의양과분포는난할유형을결정짓는중요한요인\n으로난황을많이포함하고있는단황란은불완전한\n세포질분열을한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":744,"height":452,"region":0,"bbox":[14.15,49.37,297.6,180.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-01/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":1,"sourceRect":[37.45,401.43,360.0,680.834],"width":322.55,"height":279.404,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.15,49.37,297.6,180.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"1. 일반적인난할방식에관한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.388,11.032],"spans":[{"text":"1.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,7.714,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"text":" 일반적인난할방식에관한설명으로옳은것을","bbox":[12.714,5.0,237.559,11.032],"origin":[12.714,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T10"},{"text":"<","bbox":[256.939,5.0,7.64,11.032